{{ $json.sourceTitle }}

Source URL:
{{ $json.sourceLink }}

Recent published Nuvellum titles:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.recentTitles) }}

Titles already waiting in open editorial PRs:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.openPrTitles || []) }}

